LICENSE -- PLACEHOLDER
======================

The license for the circuit-repro `engineer` environment + benchmark
is TO BE DETERMINED at publish time. This placeholder is intentional:
per the E-5 packaging ruling (2026-08-16), the license decision is
deferred and is NOT made by the release-assembly step.

No grant of rights is made by this file. Do not treat the presence of
this file as a license. Until a real license is chosen and committed,
the code is under default copyright.

Note on upstreams: the environment depends at runtime on third-party
repositories with their own licenses (AnalogGym BSD-3-Clause, ZOAF MIT,
AnalogGenie MIT, SKY130 PDK Apache-2.0). Two dependencies have UNKNOWN
redistribution status (AutoCkt: no LICENSE file; the 45nm BSIM4 model
card: no license header) and are NOT bundled -- see README_RELEASE.md
and MANIFEST.md. VACASK (AGPL-3.0) is out of scope and not bundled.
